<title>BELGIUM: EU EXTENDS DUTY-FREE MOLASSES IMPORT DUTIES.</title>
<headline>EU EXTENDS DUTY-FREE MOLASSES IMPORT DUTIES.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union molasses import duties will remain suspended for a further week until August 20, EU member state officials said.</p>
<p>The cif reference price for imports of cane molasses was set at 8.55 Ecus per 100 kg, against 8.59 Ecus previously.</p>
<p>The cif reference price for beet molasses was set at 12.68 Ecus per 100 kg, against 12.83 Ecus previously.</p>
<p>-Brussels newsroom +322 287 6830</p>
</text>
